          %p (TO ADD: The definition of a proper dg algebra, proper dg category, proper A-inf cat ???)
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proper_morphism"} Proper morphism
            %li
              %p
                Daniel Halpern-Leistner, Anatoly Preygel,
